\f1\fs19\b 1. Overview & Local-First Philosophy\b0\f0\fs17\par
UsisAIn is an open-source, local-first multimodal AI platform designed to detect scams, fraud, manipulated media, and misinformation. By installing this software, you agree to these terms.\par
\par
- \b Local-First Operation:\b0  UsisAIn operates fully offline on your computer by default using local models (Ollama). No external telemetry or scan data is collected by the software developers.\par
- \b Data Privacy:\b0  All scan histories, image uploads, vector indices, and configuration keys remain stored on your personal machine in your local user application directory (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\UsisAIn).\par
