\f1\fs19\b 3. Analysis & Disclaimer of Warranties\b0\f0\fs17\par
UsisAIn provides automated, heuristic analysis combining error level analysis (ELA), frequency domain heuristics, and AI fact-checking synthesis. \par
\par
- The scores, verdicts, and evaluations provided by UsisAIn are automated assistance tools and do not constitute formal legal, financial, or certified forensic testimony.\par
- Critical findings should always be verified against official primary sources, government advisories, and accredited news outlets.\par
